          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When it's not in danger, the shambler spends 1 minute settling into a pile that looks like a lump of loose vegetation. While it is in this form, creatures must actively Seek and succeed at a check (perception, dc:22, traits:action:seek) check (check (perception, dc:28, traits:action:seek) in forests or swamps) to detect the shambler's true nature.",
