          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The lantern archon shines as a beacon of hope.\nGood allies within 30-foot emanation gain a +3 status bonus to damage rolls and to saving throws against Wave of Despair.\nEffect: Lantern of Hope (Gestalt)",
