          "description": "5 feet. A creature that starts its turn in the aura takes 1d6 fire damage. Whenever the remorhaz takes damage from an enemy, this damage increases to 2d6 fire damage until the start of its next turn. Any creature that hits a remorhaz with an unarmed Strike takes 2d6 fire damage, and a weapon that hits a remorhaz takes 2d6 fire damage.",
