          "name": "Dream Haunting",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "If a night hag is ethereal and hovering over a sleeping chaotic or evil creature, she can ride the victim's back until dawn. The creature endures tormenting dreams as the hag casts Nightmare on it, and is exposed to abyssal plague. Any drained caused by dream haunting is cumulative.\nOnly an ethereal being can confront the night hag and stop her dream haunting.",
