          "description": "A severely damaged clay golem has a chance of going berserk. If it has 50 or fewer Hit Points at the start of its turn, the golem must succeed at a check (flat, dc:5) check or go berserk. A berserk golem wildly attacks the nearest living creature, or the nearest object if no creatures are nearby.",
