          "name": "Wing Deflection",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The silver dragon is targeted with an attack\nEffect The dragon raises its wing, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the dragon is flying, it descends 10 feet after the attack is complete.",
