          "description": "Trigger A creature within reach of the dragon's tail takes an action to Strike or attempt a skill check\nEffect The dragon Strikes with its tail at the triggering creature at a -2 penalty. If it hits, the creature takes a -2 circumstance penalty to the triggering roll.\nEffect: Tail Lash",
