          "description": "The gold dragon breathes in one of two ways.\nThe dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4.\n• Flame (arcane, fire) The dragon breathes a blast of flame in a 30-foot cone that deals 11d6 fire damage (check (reflex, dc:31, basic, traits:arcane,fire, options:area-effect) save).\n• Weakening Gas (arcane) The dragon breathes a blast of weakening gas. Each creature within a 30-foot cone must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:31, traits:arcane, options:area-effect) save or become Enfeebled 1 for 1 minute (or Enfeebled 2 on a critical failure).",
