          "name": "Breath Weapon",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The copper dragon breathes in one of two ways.\nThe dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4.\n• Acid (acid, arcane) The dragon breathes acid in a 80-foot line that deals 13d6 acid damage (check (reflex, dc:32, basic, traits:arcane,acid, options:area-effect) save).\n• Slowing Gas (arcane) The dragon breathes a 80-foot line of slowing gas. Each creature in the area must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:32, traits:arcane, options:area-effect) save or be Slowed 1 for 1 round (or Slowed 2 on a critical failure).",
