          "name": "Breath Weapon",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The bronze dragon breathes in one of two ways.\nThe dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4.\n• Lightning (arcane, electricity) The dragon breathes lightning in a 80-foot line that deals 8d12 electricity damage (check (reflex, dc:33, basic, traits:arcane,electricity, options:area-effect) save).\n• Repulsion Gas (arcane, incapacitation, mental) The dragon breathes a 80-foot line of repulsive gas. Each creature in the area must succeed at a check (will, dc:33, traits:arcane,incapacitation,mental, options:area-effect) save or become Fleeing from the dragon for 1 round (or 2 rounds on a critical failure).",
