          "name": "Slowing Frost",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "The ice devil channels the extreme cold of its body through its appendages and weapons. A creature hit by an ice devil's weapon or unarmed attack in melee must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:32) save or be Slowed 1 for 1d4. A weapon used by an ice devil gains the effects of a Frost rune while the gelugon holds it, and the ice devil can throw any such weapon with a 20-foot range increment, trailing motes of frost.",
