          "description": "50 feet. After the dragon uses its Breath Weapon, a fierce blizzard of blinding snow surrounds its body for 1 round. Everything in the aura is difficult terrain for other creatures that are on the ground, climbing, or flying. The blowing snow also makes all creatures in the area Concealed. While the blizzard rages, the dragon's dragon chill extends to the full area of the blizzard.\nEffect: Draconic Breath Weapon Aura",
