          "id": "i5jZOGRVSvmKW82C",
          "name": "Golden Luck",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The gold dragon fails a saving throw\nEffect The dragon improves its result by one degree of success, turning a failure into a success or a critical failure into a normal failure.\nThe dragon can't use this ability again for 1d4.",
