          "description": "The gold dragon breathes in one of two ways.\nThe dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4.\n• Flame (arcane, fire) The dragon breathes a blast of flame in a 40-foot cone that deals 15d6 fire damage (check (reflex, dc:37, basic, traits:arcane,fire, options:area-effect) save).\n• Weakening Gas (arcane) The dragon breathes a blast of weakening gas. Each creature within a 40-foot cone must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:37, traits:arcane, options:area-effect) save or become Enfeebled 2 for 1 minute (or Enfeebled 3 on a critical failure).",
