          "name": "Slow Aura",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "10 feet. Each creature that ends its turn in the aura must succeed at a check (will, dc:37) saving throw or be Slowed 1 for 1 round (or Slowed 2 on a critical failure). The copper dragon can turn this aura on or off with a single action, which has the concentrate trait, and can choose not to affect allies within the aura.",
