          "description": "Trigger A creature within reach of the copper dragon's tail uses a move action or leaves a square during a move action it's using.\nEffect The dragon makes a tail Strike at the creature with a -2 penalty. If it hits, the dragon disrupts the triggering action.",
          "traits": []
