          "id": "6yZ26OupmzzPO1vZ",
          "name": "Miasma",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "20 feet. After the dragon uses its Breath Weapon, a cloud of poison gas continues to emanate from its body for 1 round. Any creature that ends its turn in the miasma takes 4d6 poison damage (check (fortitude, dc:37, basic, options:area-effect) save).\nAny creature in the miasma is Concealed and treats other creatures as concealed. The dragon can see through this concealment.\nEffect: Draconic Breath Weapon Aura",
