          "id": "vmyBkhvE34HW6vpl",
          "name": "Glowing Mucus",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per day\nRequirements The vampire squid is in water\nEffect The vampire squid ejects a cloud of bioluminescent mucus in a 15-foot cone. Non-squid creatures within the cloud must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:16) save or become Sickened 1. The glowing mucus remains in the area for 1 minute, and any creature that ends its turn in the area must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:13) save or become Sickened 1.",
