          "description": "Frequency once per day\nEffect The steam mephit calls down a rain boiling water that surrounds them in a 10-foot emanation. Creatures in the area take 2d8 fire damage (check (reflex, dc:17, basic, options:area-effect) save), and small unattended flames (such as torches) are extinguished.",
