          "description": "Trigger A Medium creature within the nuglub's reach leaves a square during its move action\nEffect The nuglub lashes out at the triggering creature's knees and tries to knock them Prone. The nuglub makes an check (acrobatics) check against the creature's Reflex DC. On a success, the target falls and lands prone.",
