          "name": "Caustic Blood",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The nyogoth takes piercing or slashing damage\nEffect The nyogoth sprays its acidic blood on adjacent creatures, dealing 6d6 acid damage (check (reflex, dc:29, basic) save).",
          "traits": []
