          "name": "Feeding Frenzy",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The nyogoth has Grabbed a creature\nEffect The nyogoth slavers and chews at the grabbed creature, dealing 2d6+7 slashing damage] damage (check (fortitude, dc:29, basic) save).",
          "traits": []
