          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The hezrou is grappling a creature\nEffect Toxic fluids spurt from burst boils and weeping wens on the hezrou's body. A creature Grabbed or Restrained by the hezrou takes 2d12+6 poison damage (check (fortitude, dc:30, basic) save).",
