          "name": "Breath Weapon",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The taiga linnorm breathes a 60-foot cone of electrified vapor, dealing 20d6 electricity damage to creatures in the area (check (reflex, dc:41, basic, options:area-effect) save). The electrified mist persists for 1d4, dealing 6d6 electricity damage (check (reflex, dc:41, basic) save) to each creature that ends its turn in the mist.\nThe taiga linnorm can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4.",
