          "name": "Whiffling",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The jabberwock Flies or makes a wing Strike\nEffect The jabberwock's wings whiffle, creating severe winds within a 30-foot emanation. These winds move outward from the jabberwock, and they persist until the start of the jabberwock's next turn. During this time, flight of any kind in the emanation requires a successful Maneuver In Flight DC 43 check to Maneuver in Flight, and creatures flying toward the jabberwock are moving through greater difficult terrain. Creatures on the ground in the emanation must succeed at a check (athletics, dc:43, name:Approach Jabberwock) check to approach the jabberwock.",
