          "name": "Snake Search",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When the stheno harpist Searches or Seeks, their snakes try to help too, rolling a separate Perception check with a modifier of -1 instead of +4.\nIf the snakes notice something, they try to notify the stheno, though they are no more intelligent than normal snakes and might find different things interesting than the stheno does.",
