          "description": "Requirements The gathlain isn't using their wings to fly\nEffect The gathlain sprouts woody roots from the tips of their wings that bind an adjacent creature's limbs. The target must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:17) save or be Grabbed by the gathlain's wing-tip vines until the start of the gathlain's next turn.",
