          "kind": "action",
          "description": "check (reflex, dc:18, options:damaging-effect,inflicts:grabbed,inflicts:slowed), 1d8+2 bludgeoning damage, Escape DC 18, Rupture 5\nThe ittan-momen can Engulf only one creature. They can Engulf a creature of a larger size so long as the creature's head can feasibly be covered by the ittan-momen's body.",
