          "name": "Aura of Courage",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "15 feet. When the shabti becomes Frightened, reduce the frightened value they would gain by 1. At the end of their turn, they reduce the frightened value of all allies in the aura by 1.",
          "traits": []
